    },
    "Chippy can't use your calendar. Allow full calendar access for Chippy in Settings." : {

    },
    "Chippy chat" : {

    },
    "Chippy checks tracked flights and sends alerts when the gate, times or status change." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 会跟踪这些航班，并在登机口、时间或状态变化时提醒你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 會追蹤這些航班，並在登機門、時間或狀態變更時提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chippy could not register for notifications. Try again when you are online." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 无法注册通知。请在联网后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 無法註冊通知。請在連上網路後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chippy could not request notification permission. Try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 无法请求通知权限。请重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 無法要求通知權限。請再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chippy now supports MCP. Let AI agents add summaries, search your Library, and list your saved chips from anywhere. Open Settings → MCP Server to create an API key and copy your agent’s connection setup. Chippy doesn’t need to be open." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 现已支持 MCP。让 AI 智能体随时随地添加摘要、搜索资料库及列出已保存的摘要卡片。打开设置 → MCP 服务器，创建 API 密钥并复制智能体的连接配置。无需保持 Chippy 开启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 現已支援 MCP。讓 AI 代理隨時隨地新增摘要、搜尋資料庫及列出已儲存的摘要卡片。開啟設定 → MCP 伺服器，建立 API 金鑰並複製代理的連線設定。無需保持 Chippy 開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chippy translates the paper's title and text using your points. Existing translations are reused; only new or changed text is translated. Equations, references and images are preserved. Switch to Original to edit the paper." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 使用你的点数翻译论文的标题和正文。已有翻译会被复用，仅翻译新增或更改的文字。公式、参考文献和图片会保留。切换到「原文」即可编辑论文。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 使用你的點數翻譯論文的標題和正文。已有翻譯會被重用，僅翻譯新增或變更的文字。公式、參考文獻和圖片會保留。切換到「原文」即可編輯論文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chippy translates the summary, key points, category, tags and source text into %@. The source text can take a minute to finish." : {

    },
    "Chippy translates the trip's days, places, transport, notes and views into %@. While it's shown translated, the trip can't be edited." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 会将行程的每日安排、地点、交通、笔记和视图翻译成%@。以译文显示时，行程无法编辑。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chippy 會將行程的每日安排、地點、交通、筆記和視圖翻譯成%@。以譯文顯示時，行程無法編輯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
