            "value" : "第一次選擇語言時，摘要、重點和來源文字會被翻譯。Chippy 會記住你為此摘要所做的選擇。你分享的對象會以他們自己的語言閱讀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The title in your library. The title printed on the paper is the \\title in your main file." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是资料库中的标题。论文上印出的标题是主文件中的 \\title。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是資料庫中的標題。論文上印出的標題是主檔案中的 \\title。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tour doesn't cover this day yet. Regenerate it to include the trip as it is now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "导览尚未包含这一天。重新生成即可按行程现状加入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "導覽尚未包含這一天。重新生成即可依行程現況加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transport and its options are removed from the trip." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该交通及其方案将从行程中移除。"
