          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "該交通及其方案將從行程中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trip changed since it was translated into %@. Chippy translates what's new or changed; the rest is reused for free. While it's shown translated, the trip can't be edited." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "行程在翻译为%@后有所变动。Chippy 只会翻译新增或修改的内容，其余部分免费沿用。以翻译显示时，行程无法编辑。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "行程在翻譯為%@後有所變動。Chippy 只會翻譯新增或修改的內容，其餘部分免費沿用。以翻譯顯示時，行程無法編輯。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trip, its diary and its share link are deleted. This can't be undone." : {
